      "spam": false,
      "value": "I know we all have Discord, but being able to type a quick message or maybe even call someone for a short amount of time during vrchat can be handy. \n\nNot everybody will join every discord server of the people they meet to get , idk like a password, sent to them. This should be a rather simple solution.\n\nSince the VrChat accounts, even the Steam accounts do not sync with the steam friendlist. Maybe if they could do that somehow this wouldn't be necessary anymore.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
